sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / Platform
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Webhook as Validating Webhook<br/>9443/TCP TLS<br/>vogxserver.kb.io
    participant OGXCtrl as OGXServer Controller<br/>(OGXServerReconciler)
    participant OGXModule as OGX Module Controller<br/>(ogx-module)
    participant PlatformOp as Platform Operator
    participant Resources as Child Resources<br/>(Deployments, Services, HPAs...)
    participant Prometheus as prometheus-operator<br/>(ServiceMonitors, PrometheusRules)

    Note over User,Prometheus: Flow 1: OGXServer Reconciliation

    User->>K8sAPI: POST /apis/ogx.io/v1beta1/ogxservers<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: Admission Review (CREATE/UPDATE)<br/>HTTPS/9443, TLS
    Webhook->>Webhook: Validate OGXServer spec<br/>(failurePolicy: Fail)

    alt Validation Passes
        Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Allowed
        K8sAPI-->>User: 201 Created
    else Validation Fails
        Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Denied (reason)
        K8sAPI-->>User: 403 Forbidden
    end

    Note over OGXCtrl: Watch event triggers reconciliation

    K8sAPI-->>OGXCtrl: OGXServer watch event<br/>HTTPS/6443, TLS 1.2+
    OGXCtrl->>K8sAPI: Get OGXServer spec<br/>ServiceAccount Token
    OGXCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create/Update Deployment<br/>ServiceAccount Token
    OGXCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create/Update Service<br/>ServiceAccount Token
    OGXCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create/Update ConfigMap<br/>ServiceAccount Token
    OGXCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create/Update HPA<br/>ServiceAccount Token
    OGXCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create/Update PDB<br/>ServiceAccount Token
    OGXCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create/Update NetworkPolicy<br/>ServiceAccount Token
    OGXCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create/Update Ingress<br/>ServiceAccount Token
    OGXCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create/Update PVC<br/>ServiceAccount Token
    OGXCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create/Update ServiceMonitor<br/>ServiceAccount Token
    OGXCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create/Update PrometheusRule<br/>ServiceAccount Token
    OGXCtrl->>K8sAPI: Update OGXServer status<br/>ServiceAccount Token

    Note over User,Prometheus: Flow 2: OGX Platform Component Lifecycle

    PlatformOp->>K8sAPI: Create OGX CR<br/>(components.platform.opendatahub.io/v1alpha1)<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    K8sAPI-->>OGXModule: OGX watch event<br/>HTTPS/6443, TLS 1.2+
    OGXModule->>OGXModule: Render kustomize manifests<br/>(ODH/RHOAI overlays)
    OGXModule->>K8sAPI: Create/Update ClusterRoles<br/>ServiceAccount Token
    OGXModule->>K8sAPI: Create/Update ClusterRoleBindings<br/>ServiceAccount Token
    OGXModule->>K8sAPI: Create/Update ValidatingWebhookConfig<br/>ServiceAccount Token
    OGXModule->>K8sAPI: Create/Update Operator Deployment<br/>ServiceAccount Token
    OGXModule->>K8sAPI: Create/Update Services & PDBs<br/>ServiceAccount Token
    OGXModule->>K8sAPI: Update OGX status<br/>ServiceAccount Token

    Note over User,Prometheus: Flow 3: Configuration-Driven Rollout

    User->>K8sAPI: Update ConfigMap/Secret<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    K8sAPI-->>OGXCtrl: ConfigMap/Secret watch event
    OGXCtrl->>OGXCtrl: Detect config change
    OGXCtrl->>K8sAPI: Trigger Deployment rollout<br/>ServiceAccount Token
